<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corporacion Geo starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corporacion Geo starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Carmen Slade has started coverage of Mexican construction company Corporacion Geo SA de CV with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed on Friday at 40 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
